      "one_line": "Turns the approved architecture into a physical architecture, which services run, on what container platform and on which cloud, and designs the path through the environments Environment setup declares, with the one design each environment is built from, the pipeline for continuous integration and continuous delivery, the tests in each environment, release and rollback, where secrets and settings are kept, and the cost on each cloud, each with its reason, so every change runs the same way.",
