      "capability": "cap-deployment-design",
      "intents": [
        "bi-2"
      ],
      "one_line": "Prepares one ready cartridge for each of the three clouds, with its services, its container platforms and how to work out what running on it costs, so the design can map the project onto any of them and set the three costs side by side.",
